<title>HONG KONG: Metrobank mandates US$140 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Metrobank mandates US$140 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metropolitan Bank and Trust has mandated Deutsche Morgan Grenfell to arrange a US$140 million floating rate certificate of deposit issue, bankers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The facility has a final maturity of five years with no put or call options.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
